@startuml
title PlaceOrderSaga: entering and leaving SUSPENDED

hide empty description

state SUSPENDED #FFF8E1
state CANCELING_PAYMENT
state CONFIRMING_STOCK
state REFUNDING_PAYMENT

CANCELING_PAYMENT -down-> SUSPENDED : P16 review deadline\nP11 cancellation\nnot established
CONFIRMING_STOCK -down-> SUSPENDED : P16 review deadline
REFUNDING_PAYMENT -down-> SUSPENDED : P16 review deadline\nP15 PaymentRefundFailed

SUSPENDED -up-> CANCELING_PAYMENT : P17 retry\nP19 reject\n[payment not captured]
SUSPENDED -up-> CONFIRMING_STOCK : P17 retry\nP18 confirm\n[payment captured]
SUSPENDED -up-> REFUNDING_PAYMENT : P17 retry\nP19 reject\n[payment captured]

note bottom of SUSPENDED
  Retry returns to the remembered step.
  The answer that was missing is handled as in the
  remembered step: the saga may complete, be compensated
  or go one step further without any administrator.
  Each exit to a working state sets a new review deadline.
end note
@enduml
